# Osooly Namtheg sidecar - local secrets. Copy to sidecar/.env (gitignored).

# LLM for the fine-tuning loop + result justification (optional; the pipeline
# degrades to a static justification without it). Same OpenRouter key the
# Osooly agent layer uses as DEEPSEEK_API_KEY in the repo root .dev.vars.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""
# OPENROUTER_MODEL="deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"

# ── Shared D1 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev: leave everything empty; the sidecar auto-discovers wrangler's
# miniflare SQLite file under ../.wrangler (run `npx wrangler d1 migrations
# apply osooly --local` in the repo root first). Point D1_LOCAL_SQLITE at the
# file explicitly if discovery picks the wrong database.
# D1_LOCAL_SQLITE=""
#
# Production: use the D1 HTTP API instead (token needs the D1:edit scope).
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""
# CLOUDFLARE_D1_DATABASE_ID=""
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=""

# Shared secret for server-to-server calls (the run_automl agent tool).
# Must match NAMTHEG_INTERNAL_TOKEN in the repo root .dev.vars. Empty
# disables the internal auth path (browser sessions still work).
NAMTHEG_INTERNAL_TOKEN=""
